  "verseCount": 23,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "13",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "1SA 13"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "13",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 13:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ganni Saulo sodoma gaafa inni hayyu tahe, ammalle inni lafa Israeli ganna afurtama mohate. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.13.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.13.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 13:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sauloni nama kuma sadi fohate nama kuma lama lafa Mikimashitifi lafa gaareeni ta Betheli keesati ufi birati lakise ammo nama kuma toko ilma isaa Yonathani woliini dira Gibea ka lafa gosa Benjamini keesati, erge. Duuba inni askarti taani ch'ufa worra isaniti galche.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.13.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.13.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 13:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.13.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.13.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 13:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yonathanini gudda askarti Filisti ka Geba tau ijeese, duuba worri Filisti ch'ufti qonqo suni d'agaye. Jennaani Sauloni nama erge Magalata d'ae, worra Ebrania ka lafa ch'ufa keesa jiru yaame. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.13.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.13.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 13:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Worri Israeli ch'ufti, aka Sauloni gudda askarti Filisti ijeese, worri Filisti worra jibbe d'agaye. Tanaafi biyyiti yaamicha Sauloni worra yaame kaani d'ageennaani Gilgaliti wolti d'ufte.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.13.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.13.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 13:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.13.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.13.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 13:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Worri Filisti wolti bahe aka worra Israeli had'u; worri gaari lola ka kuma sodomatifi farda kuma jaa ka nami yaabatufi askarti heddu muumme inqamne ta aka maansa afaani galaana qaba. Duuba Mikimashi ta Bethaveni ilaboru d'aqani achiti qubatani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.13.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.13.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 13:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jennaani worra Israeli aka male had'ani lubbu keesaa baasani. Akasi arginaani worri Israeli goda d'akhafa boolafa d'akhayeefa ellaanifa bolbolafa ch'ufa keesati d'okhatani; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.13.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.13.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 13:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nami garileeni galaana Yordani taake lafa Gaditifi ta Gileadi seene.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.13.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.13.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 13:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sauloni Gilgaliti hafe, nami isa birati hafeleeni ch'ufti nahe hollate. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.13.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.13.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 13:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1SA.10.8"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Sam 10.8",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inni guyya torba akuma Samuelini isaani jed'e kaani isa eege ammo hataatu Samuelini ammalle Gilgalini imbahane. Biyyiti Saulo biraa yau feete, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.13.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.13.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 13:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "jennaani inni waan worraani jed'e, Sorio gubani baasanifi sorio wold'ageeti natiini koota, inni sorio gubani baase. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.13.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.13.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 13:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jennaani akuma inni harka iraa fud'ateeni Samuelini d'ufe. Sauloni fuula keesa deeme nagaya fuud'e, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.13.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.13.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 13:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "jennaani Samuelini waan jed'eeni, Atini maani tolchite?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.13.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.13.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 13:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sauloni waan jed'eeni, Biyyiti na bira yau feete, atinileeni hojja baantu taani ind'ufne, suni malele worri Filisti Mikimashiti wolti bau jira. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.13.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.13.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 13:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jennaani anini herege waan jed'e worri Filisti arma Gilgaliti na had'u fed'a anileeni Waaqa kad'ad'e, AABBO na eebisi injenneeni. Tanaafi anini herege sorio baasitini ya malte ufiini jed'e.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.13.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.13.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 13:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.13.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.13.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 13:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Samuelini waan jed'eeni, Atini yayu daalloofte; atini seera AABBO Waaqi kanke sii kenne gula indeemne, ato sila gula deemte inni aka siifi d'aloota kanke worra Israeli haga jiru ch'ufa dura deeme fidu isani tolcha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.13.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.13.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 13:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ACT.13.22"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Huji 13.22",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ammo amma tana atini dura deemte worra infiddu. Waan atini AABBO Waaqa seera isa gula deemu diddeefi, inni nama garaani isaa jaalatu barbaade, hayyu worra isaa tolcha.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.13.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.13.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 13:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.13.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.13.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 13:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jennaani Samuelini Gilgali kae kara ufi iti d'aabate. Biyyiti taani d'ibiini kaate, Saulo ka gara askarti isaa deemu woli yaani. Worri Gilgalini bahe, Gibea ta lafa Benjaminiti iti d'aabate. Sauloni askarti isaa ch'ufa wolti baase hede, isiini nama d'ibba jaa taate. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.13.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.13.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 13:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Saulofi ilma isaa Yonathanifi askartini worraa Geba lafa Benjamini keesati qubate; ammo worri Filisti Mikimashiti qubate. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.13.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.13.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 13:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Askartini Filisti olla isaaniti had'iisa yaate fulla saditi garagari baate; hagi toko Ofrati fulla deefate lafa Shualiti iti d'aabate; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.13.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.13.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 13:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "hagi toko Beth-Horaniti fuula deefate, taani d'ibiini seera bale Seboimutifi lafa aloo irani mullatuti qajeelte.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.13.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.13.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 13:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.13.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.13.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 13:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wonti tumtuni tokoleeni lafa Israeli keesa injirreefi maro worri Filisti gosa Ebrania woraanafi goraadee tumu d'owefi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.13.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.13.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 13:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "(Worri Israeli Filisti d'aqe maarasha, jembe, d'agaraafi haamtu qarachu male; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.13.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.13.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 13:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "horini huji suni baasani kana; hojja d'agaraafi sururu qarani yokhaani mid'aasani beesuma diqo baasani. Ammo hojja maarashafi jembe qarani hagasi lama baasani.) ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.13.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.13.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 13:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tanaafi guyya lola suni askartini Israeli, Saulofi ilma isa Yonathani male, tokoleeni ta goraadeefi woraana qabdu injirtu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.13.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.13.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 13:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.13.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.13.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 13:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Worri Filisti askarti gari kaarra Mikimashiti erge, aka achiti nyaapa dabru d'owani.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.13.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.13.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Jannooma Yonathani",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
